  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.76 Working face",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.76 “Working face” means the portion of a landfill where solid waste is being actively deposited, spread, compacted, and covered.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05 (from Env-Sw 104.66); ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 104.67) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
